msgstr "Estado del flujo de trabajo automatizado"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_account_bank_statement_line__automation_runtime_id
msgid "Latest workflow started from this line, ignoring cancelled ones."
msgstr "Último flujo de trabajo iniciado desde esta línea, sin contar los cancelados."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_ir_actions_server__run_at_start
msgid "Run at Start"
msgstr "Ejecutar al iniciar"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_ir_actions_server__run_at_start
msgid ""
"Execute this step as soon as a workflow started from a bank statement line "
"begins, if the step is ready by then. Only for steps that create no "
"document, such as registering the statement line."
msgstr ""
"Ejecuta este paso en cuanto inicia un flujo de trabajo creado desde una "
"línea de estado de cuenta, si para entonces el paso está listo. Solo para "
"pasos que no crean documentos, como registrar la línea del estado de cuenta."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_res_company__automation_intercompany_journal_id
msgid "Intercompany Collection Journal"
msgstr "Diario de cobranza intercompañía"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_res_company__automation_intercompany_journal_id
msgid ""
"Journal this company books a collection in when another company's bank "
"received the money: the customer's receivable is settled against what the "
"receiving company owes this one."
msgstr ""
"Diario en el que esta compañía registra un cobro cuando el dinero entró al "
"banco de otra compañía: la cuenta por cobrar del cliente se salda contra lo "
"que la compañía que recibió le debe a esta."

#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:automation_account.selection__ir_actions_server__state__workflow_register_statement
msgid "Register Bank Statement Line"
msgstr "Registrar línea de estado de cuenta"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:automation_account.selection__ir_actions_server__state__workflow_create_document
msgid "Create Document from Template"
msgstr "Crear documento desde plantilla"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:automation_account.selection__ir_actions_server__state__workflow_reconcile_statement
msgid "Reconcile Bank Statement Line"
msgstr "Conciliar línea de estado de cuenta"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:automation_account.selection__ir_actions_server__state__workflow_apply_credit_note
msgid "Apply Credit Note to Open Invoices"
msgstr "Aplicar nota de crédito a facturas abiertas"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_ir_actions_server__workflow_template_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_ir_cron__workflow_template_id
msgid "Document Template"
msgstr "Plantilla del documento"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_ir_actions_server__workflow_template_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_ir_cron__workflow_template_id
msgid ""
"The template a Create Document step fills in with the run's partner, amount,"
" date and reference."
msgstr ""
"La plantilla que un paso de crear documento llena con el contacto, el "
"importe, la fecha y la referencia de la ejecución."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_ir_actions_server__workflow_company_source
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_ir_cron__workflow_company_source
