msgstr "Fecha"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:automation_account.selection__ir_actions_server__workflow_date_source__run
msgid "Run's Date"
msgstr "Fecha de la ejecución"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:automation_account.selection__ir_actions_server__workflow_date_source__document
msgid "Latest Document of the Run"
msgstr "Último documento de la ejecución"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:automation_account.selection__ir_actions_server__workflow_date_source__today
msgid "Day the Step Runs"
msgstr "Día en que se ejecuta el paso"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_ir_actions_server__workflow_tax_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_ir_cron__workflow_tax_ids
msgid "Replace Taxes With"
msgstr "Reemplazar impuestos por"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_ir_actions_server__workflow_tax_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_ir_cron__workflow_tax_ids
msgid ""
"When set, every line of the document carries these taxes instead of its "
"product's. In another company, the tax of the same name and use is taken."
msgstr ""
"Si se indica, todas las líneas del documento llevan estos impuestos en lugar"
" de los de su producto. En otra compañía se toma el impuesto del mismo "
"nombre y uso."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_ir_actions_server__workflow_auto_post
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_ir_cron__workflow_auto_post
msgid "Post the Document"
msgstr "Publicar el documento"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_ir_actions_server__workflow_auto_post
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_ir_cron__workflow_auto_post
msgid ""
"Post the document as soon as it is created. Leave it off to review the draft"
" first."
msgstr ""
"Publica el documento en cuanto se crea. Desactívelo para revisar primero el "
"borrador."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_automation_runtime__problem_message
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_wizard_account_bank_statement_line_start_automation__problem_message
msgid "What Would Stop This Run"
msgstr "Qué detendría esta ejecución"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_automation_runtime__problem_message
msgid ""
"What the steps still to run are missing, read from the steps that declare "
"what they do."
msgstr ""
"Lo que les falta a los pasos pendientes, según los pasos que declaran lo que"
" hacen."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_wizard_account_bank_statement_line_start_automation__plan_preview
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:automation_account.view_automation_runtime_create_form
msgid "What This Run Does"
msgstr "Qué hace esta ejecución"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_wizard_account_bank_statement_line_start_automation__plan_preview
msgid ""
"What each step of the workflow does with the values above, for the steps "
"that declare it."
msgstr ""
"Lo que hace cada paso del flujo de trabajo con los valores de arriba, para "
"los pasos que lo declaran."

#. module: automation_account
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:automation_account.view_automation_runtime_create_form
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:automation_account.view_automation_runtime_form
msgid "<strong>This run cannot complete as it stands:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Esta ejecución no puede terminar como está:</strong>"

#. module: automation_account
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:automation_account.ir_actions_server_view_form_workflow_steps
msgid "Links the journal entry of the run's bank statement line to this step."
msgstr ""
"Vincula a este paso el asiento de la línea de estado de cuenta de la "
"ejecución."

#. module: automation_account
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:automation_account.ir_actions_server_view_form_workflow_steps
msgid ""
"Reconciles the run's bank statement line with the nearest document a "
"previous step created."
msgstr ""
"Concilia la línea de estado de cuenta de la ejecución con el documento más "
"cercano creado por un paso anterior."

#. module: automation_account
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:automation_account.ir_actions_server_view_form_workflow_steps
msgid ""
"Applies the nearest credit note a previous step created to its partner's "
"open invoices, oldest first."
msgstr ""
"Aplica la nota de crédito más cercana creada por un paso anterior a las "
"facturas abiertas de su contacto, de la más antigua a la más reciente."

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid "%(document)s in %(journal)s of %(company)s, issued to %(partner)s"
msgstr "%(document)s en %(journal)s de %(company)s, emitido a %(partner)s"

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid "%(template)s. In: %(company)s. To: %(partner)s"
msgstr "%(template)s. En: %(company)s. A: %(partner)s"

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid "Payment"
msgstr "Pago"

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid "nobody"
msgstr "nadie"

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid "'%(step)s' creates a payment, and this run has no amount."
msgstr "'%(step)s' crea un pago, y esta ejecución no tiene importe."

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid ""
"'%(step)s' creates its document in journal %(journal)s, which %(company)s "
"does not have."
msgstr ""
"'%(step)s' crea su documento en el diario %(journal)s, que %(company)s no "
"tiene."

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid "'%(step)s' issues its document to a partner, and this run names none."
msgstr ""
"'%(step)s' emite su documento a un contacto, y esta ejecución no indica "
"ninguno."

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid "'%(step)s' needs a bank statement line, and this run names none."
msgstr ""
"'%(step)s' necesita una línea de estado de cuenta, y esta ejecución no "
"indica ninguna."

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid ""
"'%(step)s' settles a bank statement line of %(line_company)s against the "
"document '%(document)s' creates in %(company)s, and %(company)s has no "
"Intercompany Collection Journal."
msgstr ""
"'%(step)s' salda una línea de estado de cuenta de %(line_company)s contra el"
" documento que '%(document)s' crea en %(company)s, y %(company)s no tiene "
"diario de cobranza intercompañía."

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid "Bank statement line %(line)s has no journal entry yet."
msgstr "La línea de estado de cuenta %(line)s aún no tiene asiento contable."

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid "Step '%(step)s' creates a document from a template but names none."
msgstr ""
"El paso '%(step)s' crea un documento desde una plantilla, pero no indica "
"ninguna."

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid "Step '%(step)s' only runs as part of a workflow run."
msgstr ""
"El paso '%(step)s' solo se ejecuta como parte de una ejecución de flujo de "
"trabajo."

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid ""
"Step '%(step)s' replaces the taxes with '%(tax)s', which %(company)s does "
"not have."
msgstr ""
"El paso '%(step)s' reemplaza los impuestos por '%(tax)s', que %(company)s no"
" tiene."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model,name:automation_account.model_res_company
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_automation_runtime__company_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_wizard_account_bank_statement_line_start_automation__company_ids
msgid "Companies"
msgstr "Compañías"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:automation_account.selection__ir_actions_server__workflow_company_source__statement
msgid "Bank Statement Line's Company"
msgstr "Compañía de la línea de estado de cuenta"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:automation_account.selection__ir_actions_server__workflow_date_source__statement
msgid "Bank Statement Line's Date"
msgstr "Fecha de la línea de estado de cuenta"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:automation_account.selection__ir_actions_server__workflow_company_source__transaction
msgid "Company that Holds the Transaction"
msgstr "Compañía titular de la operación"

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_wizard_account_bank_statement_line_start_automation__company_ids
msgid ""
"Every company the run creates documents in. It starts with the company of "
"the bank statement line; add the company that holds the transaction with the"
" partner when another one's bank received the money."
msgstr ""
"Todas las compañías en las que la ejecución crea documentos. Empieza con la "
"compañía de la línea de estado de cuenta; agregue la compañía titular de la "
"operación con el contacto cuando el dinero entró al banco de otra."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_automation_runtime__company_ids
msgid ""
"Every company this run creates documents in; the run is listed in each of "
"them. With two, the one that owns the bank statement line is the vehicle "
"that received the money and the other holds the transaction with the "
"partner."
msgstr ""
"Todas las compañías en las que esta ejecución crea documentos; la ejecución "
"aparece en cada una. Cuando son dos, la dueña de la línea de estado de "
"cuenta es el vehículo que recibió el dinero y la otra es la titular de la "
"operación con el contacto."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:automation_account.selection__ir_actions_server__workflow_partner_source__third_party
msgid "Run's Third Party"
msgstr "Tercero de la ejecución"

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/automation_runtime.py:0
msgid ""
"The bank statement line belongs to %(company)s, which is not one of this "
"run's companies."
msgstr ""
"La línea de estado de cuenta pertenece a %(company)s, que no es una de las "
"compañías de esta ejecución."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_ir_actions_server__workflow_company_source
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_ir_cron__workflow_company_source
msgid ""
"The company the document is created in. When another company's bank received"
" the money, that company is the bank statement line's and the other one "
"holds the transaction with the partner; a run of one company has only that "
"one. A template that belongs to no company is created in the one that holds "
"the transaction."
msgstr ""
"La compañía en la que se crea el documento. Cuando el dinero entró al banco "
"de otra compañía, esa es la de la línea de estado de cuenta y la otra es la "
"titular de la operación con el contacto; una ejecución de una sola compañía "
"solo tiene esa. Una plantilla que no pertenece a ninguna compañía se crea en"
" la titular de la operación."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_ir_actions_server__workflow_date_source
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_ir_cron__workflow_date_source
msgid ""
"The date the document carries. The bank statement line's date is the day the"
" money came in, whatever date the run was given; a run without one uses its "
"own date. An invoice stamped days after the date it carries is refused by "
"the tax authority, which is what the day the step runs avoids."
msgstr ""
"La fecha que lleva el documento. La fecha de la línea de estado de cuenta es"
" el día en que entró el dinero, sea cual sea la fecha que se le dio a la "
"ejecución; una ejecución sin línea usa su propia fecha. La autoridad fiscal "
"rechaza una factura timbrada días después de la fecha que lleva; usar el día"
" en que se ejecuta el paso lo evita."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_automation_runtime__partner_id
msgid ""
"The partner the operation is about: the customer whose debt a collection "
"reduces, whoever a document is made out to."
msgstr ""
"El contacto de quien trata la operación: el cliente cuya deuda reduce un "
"cobro, sin importar a nombre de quién se emita un documento."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_automation_runtime__third_party_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_wizard_account_bank_statement_line_start_automation__third_party_id
msgid ""
"The party a fiscal document is made out to when it is not the partner, such "
"as the generic public for a customer who takes no invoice. Leave it empty "
"when the partner is invoiced himself."
msgstr ""
"A quien se emite un documento fiscal cuando no es el contacto, como el "
"público en general para un cliente que no pide factura. Déjelo vacío cuando "
"se le factura al propio contacto."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_automation_runtime__third_party_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:automation_account.field_wizard_account_bank_statement_line_start_automation__third_party_id
msgid "Third Party"
msgstr "Tercero"

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/automation_runtime.py:0
msgid ""
"This run names %(count)s companies. A step tells the company that received "
"the money from the one that holds the transaction, so a run works in two at "
"most."
msgstr ""
"Esta ejecución indica %(count)s compañías. Un paso distingue la compañía que"
" recibió el dinero de la titular de la operación, así que una ejecución "
"trabaja en dos como máximo."

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/automation_runtime.py:0
msgid ""
"This run names two companies and no bank statement line, so nothing says "
"which of them received the money."
msgstr ""
"Esta ejecución indica dos compañías y ninguna línea de estado de cuenta, así"
" que nada dice cuál de ellas recibió el dinero."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_ir_actions_server__workflow_partner_source
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:automation_account.field_ir_cron__workflow_partner_source
msgid ""
"Who the document is issued to. A run that names no third party issues it to "
"its partner."
msgstr ""
"A quién se emite el documento. Si la ejecución no indica un tercero, se "
"emite a su contacto."

#. module: automation_account
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:automation_account.view_automation_runtime_search
msgid "With Third Party"
msgstr "Con tercero"

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/automation_runtime.py:0
msgid ""
"Workflow %(run)s works in a company your user does not belong to. Ask an "
"administrator to give you every company of the run."
msgstr ""
"El flujo de trabajo %(run)s trabaja en una compañía a la que su usuario no "
"pertenece. Pida a un administrador acceso a todas las compañías de la "
"ejecución."

#. module: automation_account
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:automation_account.selection__ir_actions_server__state__workflow_change_partner
msgid "Change Partner of a Document"
msgstr "Cambiar contacto de un documento"

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid "The document before it, issued again to %(partner)s"
msgstr "El documento anterior, emitido de nuevo a %(partner)s"

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid ""
"'%(step)s' issues a document again to a partner, and this run names none."
msgstr ""
"'%(step)s' emite de nuevo un documento a un contacto, y esta ejecución no "
"indica ninguno."

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid "To: %(partner)s"
msgstr "A: %(partner)s"

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid "'%(step)s' found no document of an earlier step to issue again."
msgstr ""
"'%(step)s' no encontró un documento de un paso anterior para emitirlo de "
"nuevo."

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid ""
"'%(step)s' issues %(document)s again to a partner, and the run names none."
msgstr ""
"'%(step)s' emite de nuevo %(document)s a un contacto, y la ejecución no "
"indica ninguno."

#. module: automation_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/automation_account/models/ir_actions_server.py:0
msgid ""
"%(document)s is already applied to other documents. Remove what it settles "
"before issuing it to %(partner)s."
msgstr ""
"%(document)s ya está aplicado a otros documentos. Quite lo que salda antes "
"de emitirlo a %(partner)s."

#. module: automation_account
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:automation_account.ir_actions_server_view_form_workflow_steps
msgid ""
"Issues the nearest document a previous step created to this partner "
"instead, keeping its number and date. It refuses a document already applied "
"to others, or one whose electronic invoice the tax authority must cancel "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Emite a este contacto, en su lugar, el documento más cercano que creó un "
"paso anterior, conservando su número y fecha. Rechaza un documento ya "
"aplicado a otros, o uno cuya factura electrónica deba cancelarse primero "
"ante el SAT."

